  "text": "maya-agent: Hi Alvarez — here are my slots for next week (working hours Mon–Fri 09:00–17:00; I only have a conflict with one).\n\n- Mon 10:00-10:30 — free ✅ (my preference, I break right after the CSE452 lecture at 10:00 and office hours start at 10:30)\n- Mon 14:00-14:30 — free ✅ (between quiz section and grading)\n- Tue 11:00-11:30 — ❌ busy (CSE444 project focus, 10:00-11:30)\n- Tue 15:00-15:30 — free ✅\n- Wed 10:00-10:30 — free ✅ (between reading group and CSE452 lab)\n- Wed 13:00-13:30 — free ✅ (between advisor 1:1 and study group)\n\nSo anything except Tue 11:00 works for me: Mon 10:00 is my first choice, then Wed 10:00, then Tue 15:00. Out of the office beyond 17:00 — my working hours are 09:00-17:00, so all of these are fine.",
